{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-3m-versaflo-intrinsically-safe-powered-air-turbo-tr802e-2602-0262","content_id":"bc82d978-41ce-435c-87e7-cfc82e327e48","description":"Product Recall for 3M Versaflo Intrinsically Safe Powered Air Turbo presenting a high risk of fire and explosion.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"d2fc041d-3eaf-4716-b32a-eccc6789a9e3","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-05-28T11:06:16+01:00","id":"d2fc041d-3eaf-4716-b32a-eccc6789a9e3","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-05-28T11:06:16+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a181398c7335e2ca6daac54/2602-0262-product-recall-3M-versaflo-intrinsically-safe-powered-air-turbo.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: 3M Versaflo Intrinsically Safe Powered Air Turbo TR802E</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of fire and explosion because it may contain battery contact pin assemblies that differ from the design validated during the Intrinsic Safety (IS) certification process. This means the product may not perform to its certified level of ignition protection in explosive atmospheres.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users by 3M.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Personal Protective Equipment (PPE) - Environmental Respiratory Protection - Powered</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>3M</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Serial Numbers Affected</td>\n      <td>TR802E048162-TR802E048182; TR802E048184-TR802E048195; TR802E048199-TR802E048204; TR802E048207-TR802E048253; TR802E048255-TR802E048449; TR802E048457; TR802E048459; TR802E048468; TR802E048470; TR802E048481; TR802E048487; TR802E048492; TR802E048505; TR802E048509-TR802E048526; TR802E048528-TR802E048548; TR802E048550-TR802E048551</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>United States</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>The product is an ATEX Certified belt mounted air purifying device that can be used in certain potentially explosive atmospheres. When combined with an approved head top or facepiece, it forms a power assisted system for respiratory protection against particles, nuisance odours, gases and vapours. The product is designed for industrial/occupational use.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_d2fc041d-3eaf-4716-b32a-eccc6789a9e3\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a181398c7335e2ca6daac54/2602-0262-product-recall-3M-versaflo-intrinsically-safe-powered-air-turbo.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-identifiers\">Additional Identifiers</h3>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">SAP ID</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Description</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>7100169180</td>\n      <td>3M™ Versaflo™ Powered Air Purifying Respirator Starter Kit, Intrinsically Safe, TR-819E</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>7100169179</td>\n      <td>3M™ Versaflo™ Powered Air Purifying Respirator Unit TR-802E, Intrinsically Safe</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>7100233732</td>\n      <td>3M™ Versaflo™ Powered Air Purifying Respirator Paint Spray Ready Kit TR-800E PSK</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>7100233763</td>\n      <td>3M™ Versaflo™ Powered Air Purifying Respirator Easy Clean Ready Kit TR-800E ECK</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>7100233766</td>\n      <td>3M™ Versaflo™ Powered Air Purifying Respirator Heavy Industry Ready Kit TR-800E HIK</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>7100317689</td>\n      <td>3M™ Versaflo™ Industrial Helmet with Hood Powered Air Respirator Kit TR-800-IHK</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk of fire and explosion because it may contain battery contact pin assemblies that differ from the design validated during the Intrinsic Safety (IS) certification process. This means the product may not perform to its certified level of ignition protection in explosive atmospheres.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Personal Protective Equipment (Enforcement) Regulations 2018 and The Equipment and Protective Systems Intended for Use in Potentially Explosive Atmospheres Regulations 2016 (ATEX).</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users by 3M.</p>\n\n<p>Users are advised to stop using the product immediately and check the label on the bottom of the product housing for the serial number. If it is in the affected range, visit <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.3m.co.uk/3M/en_GB/worker-health-safety-uk/news-events/versaflotr800-replace/?utm_medium=redirect&amp;utm_source=vanity-url&amp;utm_campaign=3m.co.uk/VersafloTR800-Replace\">https://www.3m.co.uk/3M/en_GB/worker-health-safety-uk/news-events/versaflotr800-replace/</a> to arrange a replacement.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2602-0262</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Health and Safety Executive</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-05-28T10:08:45Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-identifiers","level":3,"text":"Additional Identifiers"}],"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"